{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "HNN Biller — ERHEAT Shield API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Emergency micro-loans on six lines (rent, health, education, energy, agriculture, transport). **The Biller never lends or holds funds**: it verifies the need through the person who knows it, takes the borrower’s consent and hands a Verified-Need Packet to the lender, who decides and pays the payee. Covers the borrower API (used by the ER HEAT app), health sync with Biller bills, the optional profile, history, verifier and voucher pages, lender hooks, Master Control and partner accounts. Everything is in GHS.\n\nThe lender contract (decision, paid and repayment hooks, signed push with `x-erheat-signature: sha256=<HMAC-SHA256 of the raw body>`) is HNN’s own proposal and is not confirmed with any lender.\n\n_6th Edition (Revised), 18 October 2026._"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://nextgenhnnbiller-production-bdf1.up.railway.app"
    },
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:4000"
    }
  ],
